{"seq":3,"slug":"causal-consistency-clocks","title":"因果一致性与时钟","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/local-first-sync-engines/data-consistency/causal-consistency-clocks","wordCount":1800,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"因果一致性与时钟\">因果一致性与时钟</h1><p>&quot;谁先谁后&quot;这个幼儿园都会的问题，在分布式系统里是个深渊。墙上时钟会漂移、会被手动改、会因时区与 NTP 跳变而相互矛盾，所以本地优先系统从不用物理时间来定序，而是用<strong>逻辑时钟</strong>捕捉事件间的因果关系。前两篇反复提到的&quot;时间戳大者胜&quot;&quot;稳定身份&quot;，底层都靠本节讲的因果序撑着。这是理解 CRDT 为何成立的底座。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>关键区分是<strong>因果序（causal order）<strong>与</strong>物理时间</strong>。如果事件 A 的结果被 B 看到了（B 是在知道 A 之后发生的），那 A 因果先于 B，记作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\to B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>。如果两个事件谁也没看到谁，它们是**并发（concurrent）**的，记作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\parallel B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>——因果序无法定义它们的先后，这恰恰对应 <a href=\"../foundations/offline-conflict-challenges\">离线与冲突的本质挑战</a> 里说的&quot;并发不等于冲突&quot;。</p>\n<p>逻辑时钟的目标就是：<strong>用本地可计算的方式捕捉这个因果序</strong>，不依赖同步的物理时间。下图展示三种逐级增强的逻辑时钟：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[需要给事件定序] --&gt; B[Lamport 时钟]&#10;  B --&gt; C[单调计数&lt;br/&gt;能保证因果则计数递增]&#10;  C --&gt; D[但反过来不成立&lt;br/&gt;无法判断是否并发]&#10;  D --&gt; E[向量时钟]&#10;  E --&gt; F[每副本一个计数器&lt;br/&gt;能精确判断并发]&#10;  F --&gt; G[但大小随副本数增长]&#10;  G --&gt; H[混合逻辑时钟 HLC]&#10;  H --&gt; I[物理时间 + 逻辑计数&lt;br/&gt;接近真实时间又保因果]\">flowchart TD\n  A[需要给事件定序] --&gt; B[Lamport 时钟]\n  B --&gt; C[单调计数&lt;br/&gt;能保证因果则计数递增]\n  C --&gt; D[但反过来不成立&lt;br/&gt;无法判断是否并发]\n  D --&gt; E[向量时钟]\n  E --&gt; F[每副本一个计数器&lt;br/&gt;能精确判断并发]\n  F --&gt; G[但大小随副本数增长]\n  G --&gt; H[混合逻辑时钟 HLC]\n  H --&gt; I[物理时间 + 逻辑计数&lt;br/&gt;接近真实时间又保因果]</pre><p>下表是三种时钟的速查对照：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时钟</th>\n<th>结构</th>\n<th>能判断并发？</th>\n<th>大小</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Lamport</td>\n<td>单个整数</td>\n<td>否（只能保证 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A\\to B \\Rightarrow L(A)&lt;L(B)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>全序场景、轻量定序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>向量时钟</td>\n<td>每副本一个计数器</td>\n<td>是（精确）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，n=副本数</td>\n<td>需检测并发的 CRDT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版本向量</td>\n<td>向量时钟的变体</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>副本级别的&quot;已见&quot;追踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HLC</td>\n<td>物理时间 + 逻辑位</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>需贴近墙钟又要因果</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"lamport-时钟-最小可行的因果\">Lamport 时钟：最小可行的因果</h2><p>Lamport 在 1978 年提出的时钟是逻辑时间的起点，规则只有三条：每个进程维护一个计数器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>；本地发生事件时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>←</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L \\leftarrow L + 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>；收到带时间戳 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的消息时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>←</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L \\leftarrow \\max(L, t) + 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>它保证一个单向蕴含：若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\to B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L(A) &lt; L(B)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这足以构造一个<strong>全序</strong>——把 Lamport 值相同的事件再用副本 ID 打破平局，所有事件就能排成一条线。这正是 LWW-Register（见 <a href=\"crdts-for-apps\">应用层 CRDT</a>）&quot;时间戳大者胜&quot;的可靠实现方式：用 Lamport 值 + 副本 ID 替代不可靠的墙钟。</p>\n<p>但 Lamport 时钟有个根本局限：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L(A) &lt; L(B)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 不能反推 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\to B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>。两个并发事件也可能有不同的 Lamport 值——它无法区分&quot;真的有因果先后&quot;和&quot;只是计数恰好不同&quot;。要回答&quot;这两个事件到底是并发还是有因果关系&quot;，需要更强的工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"向量时钟-精确捕捉并发\">向量时钟：精确捕捉并发</h2><p>向量时钟（Vector Clock）给每个副本维护<strong>一整个向量</strong>，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 位记录&quot;我所知道的副本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的事件计数&quot;。规则：本地事件让自己那一位加一；收消息时逐位取较大值，再把自己那位加一。</p>\n<p>它的强大在于能精确判断两个向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的关系：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>B</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>每位</mtext><mo>≤</mo><mtext>且至少一位</mtext><mo>&lt;</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\to B \\iff V_A &lt; V_B \\quad(\\text{每位} \\le \\text{且至少一位} &lt;)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7073em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">每位</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">且至少一位</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>若两个向量互不&quot;小于等于&quot;——即各有一位比对方大——则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\parallel B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>，它们是并发的。这正是 CRDT 检测冲突所需的判断：知道两次写入是因果有序（直接采用后者）还是并发（必须走合并逻辑）。版本向量（Version Vector）是它的近亲，专门追踪&quot;每个副本已经见过对方多少更新&quot;，是同步引擎做增量传输时判断&quot;该发哪些变更&quot;的依据——<a href=\"../engines/replicache-partial-sync\">部分同步与查询订阅</a> 里的差量同步正建立在这种&quot;已见&quot;追踪上。</p>\n<p>向量时钟的代价是<strong>大小随副本数线性增长</strong>。对一个有大量短暂客户端的系统（每个浏览器标签页都是一个副本），向量可能膨胀得失控。压缩版本向量、回收离线副本的条目是工程上的常见难题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"混合逻辑时钟-兼顾墙钟与因果\">混合逻辑时钟：兼顾墙钟与因果</h2><p>向量时钟精确但昂贵，Lamport 轻量但不贴近真实时间——而很多产品又确实想让时间戳&quot;看起来像真实时间&quot;（用于展示、排序、调试）。**混合逻辑时钟（HLC, Hybrid Logical Clock）**是 2014 年提出、到 2026 年被 CockroachDB、众多本地优先系统广泛采用的折中方案。</p>\n<p>HLC 把时间戳拆成两部分：一个物理时间分量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">pt</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">pt</span></span></span></span></span> 和一个有界的逻辑计数分量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span>。更新规则保证：若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\to B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>，则 HLC<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(A) &lt;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span></span></span></span></span> HLC<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(B)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（先比物理分量，相等再比逻辑分量）。同时 HLC 的物理分量始终贴近真实墙钟（误差有界），所以时间戳既能保因果序、又能当近似的真实时间来读。这解决了 LWW 的核心痛点——前文 <a href=\"../foundations/offline-conflict-challenges\">离线与冲突的本质挑战</a> 说&quot;时间不可信&quot;，HLC 正是让时间戳重新变得可用于定序、而不被时钟漂移坑害的关键。</p>\n<p>下图说明 HLC 如何在两个分量间协调：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[新事件发生] --&gt; B{本地物理时钟 &gt; 当前HLC物理位?}&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C[物理位=本地时钟&lt;br/&gt;逻辑位归零]&#10;  B --&gt;|否| D[物理位不变&lt;br/&gt;逻辑位加一]&#10;  E[收到远端HLC] --&gt; F[物理位取三者最大&lt;br/&gt;本地/远端/旧值]&#10;  F --&gt; G[逻辑位据情况递增&lt;br/&gt;保证单调]\">graph TD\n  A[新事件发生] --&gt; B{本地物理时钟 &gt; 当前HLC物理位?}\n  B --&gt;|是| C[物理位=本地时钟&lt;br/&gt;逻辑位归零]\n  B --&gt;|否| D[物理位不变&lt;br/&gt;逻辑位加一]\n  E[收到远端HLC] --&gt; F[物理位取三者最大&lt;br/&gt;本地/远端/旧值]\n  F --&gt; G[逻辑位据情况递增&lt;br/&gt;保证单调]</pre><h2 id=\"因果一致性-比强一致弱-比最终一致强\">因果一致性：比强一致弱、比最终一致强</h2><p>时钟服务于一个更高层的目标——<strong>因果一致性（causal consistency）</strong>。它是一种介于强一致与最终一致之间的保证：所有副本看到的因果相关事件顺序一致，但并发事件的顺序可以各看各的。</p>\n<p>为什么这个保证对本地优先恰到好处？强一致要求全局协调，离线就做不到；纯最终一致则可能让用户看到&quot;回复早于原帖&quot;这种因果倒错的诡异状态。因果一致性在不牺牲离线可用的前提下，杜绝了因果倒错——它保证&quot;你看到了回复，就一定先看到过原帖&quot;。聊天、协作、工作流这类系统大多需要因果一致，而它正是靠向量时钟或版本向量在 CRDT 之上额外维护因果序来实现的。下表对比三种一致性强度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>一致性</th>\n<th>保证</th>\n<th>离线可用</th>\n<th>典型代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>强一致</td>\n<td>全局单一顺序</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>需协调，分区即不可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>因果一致</td>\n<td>因果相关事件顺序一致</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>需维护因果元数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最终一致</td>\n<td>最终收敛，过程顺序不保证</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>可能短暂因果倒错</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>本地优先用逻辑时钟捕捉因果序而非物理时间，因为墙钟漂移、不可靠。</li>\n<li>Lamport 时钟轻量、能构造全序，但无法判断并发；它是 LWW &quot;时间戳&quot;的可靠实现。</li>\n<li>向量时钟/版本向量能精确判断因果与并发，是 CRDT 冲突检测和差量同步的基础，代价是大小随副本数增长。</li>\n<li>HLC 用&quot;物理分量 + 逻辑分量&quot;让时间戳既保因果序又贴近真实时间，是 2026 年广泛采用的折中。</li>\n<li>这些时钟服务于因果一致性——比强一致弱、比最终一致强，杜绝因果倒错，正合本地优先所需。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章上一篇：<a href=\"crdts-for-apps\">应用层 CRDT</a> —— 时钟为这些数据结构提供定序底座。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-data/crdt-fundamentals\">CRDT 基础</a> —— 实时协作中因果与并发的另一视角。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"因果一致性与时钟","id":"因果一致性与时钟"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Lamport 时钟：最小可行的因果","id":"lamport-时钟-最小可行的因果"},{"level":2,"text":"向量时钟：精确捕捉并发","id":"向量时钟-精确捕捉并发"},{"level":2,"text":"混合逻辑时钟：兼顾墙钟与因果","id":"混合逻辑时钟-兼顾墙钟与因果"},{"level":2,"text":"因果一致性：比强一致弱、比最终一致强","id":"因果一致性-比强一致弱-比最终一致强"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"OT 与 CRDT 对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/local-first-sync-engines/data-consistency/ot-vs-crdt"},"next":{"title":"Yjs 与协作文档","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/local-first-sync-engines/engines/yjs-collaborative"}}